# cppcheck suppressions, each with the reason it is not a bug here.

# The public API is written for a bench that is still being built: functions
# land with their tests before the screen that calls them exists.  An unused
# public function is a to-do, not a defect, and STATUS.md tracks those.
unusedFunction

# cppcheck cannot see the three build systems, so every header looks like it
# has an unused include from the one translation unit it is scanning.
missingIncludeSystem
unmatchedSuppression
